{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653510/extras/neutral__wide_set___mirorred_2.png?t=1746614127\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653510/extras/TOP_-_goals___615___red_b.gif?t=1746614127\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653510/extras/615__neutral___mustard_b.png?t=1746614127\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653510/extras/total_offensive_-_no_arrows_-_left_shot_-_mustard_b.png?t=1746614127\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653510/extras/battlefields__615__mustard_b.png?t=1746614127\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653510/extras/bar______itled.png?t=1746614127\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Coordinated multi - angle offensive is the most important feature of this game.  It allows to create scoring opportunities from many angles simultaneously what makes for a dynamic and exciting play.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Simply  direct any two points from your team towards the opponent's net and score if the line is open.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game features three board designs with zoom options which can additionally be personalized with use of a screen drawing program. Simple rules - great actions !!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653510/extras/bar______itled.png?t=1746614127\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\"